    {
      "id": "hook-0",
      "section": "hook",
      "start": 2,
      "seconds": 2.078,
      "file": "assets/vo/hook-0.wav",
      "text": "Five friends are saving for a trip."
    },
    {
      "id": "hook-1",
      "section": "hook",
      "start": 4.66,
      "seconds": 2.165,
      "file": "assets/vo/hook-1.wav",
      "text": "One of them collects everyone’s money."
    },
    {
      "id": "hook-2",
      "section": "hook",
      "start": 7.407,
      "seconds": 4.938,
      "file": "assets/vo/hook-2.wav",
      "text": "Now one person carries all the risk — and everyone else just has to trust them."
    },
    {
      "id": "problem-0",
      "section": "problem",
      "start": 13.927,
      "seconds": 2.59,
      "file": "assets/vo/problem-0.wav",
      "text": "That’s how group saving works almost everywhere."
    },
    {
      "id": "problem-1",
      "section": "problem",
      "start": 17.099,
      "seconds": 1.433,
      "file": "assets/vo/problem-1.wav",
      "text": "Someone holds the pot."
    },
    {
      "id": "problem-2",
      "section": "problem",
      "start": 19.114,
      "seconds": 1.489,
      "file": "assets/vo/problem-2.wav",
      "text": "Nobody else can check it."
    },
    {
      "id": "problem-3",
      "section": "problem",
      "start": 21.185,
      "seconds": 2.271,
      "file": "assets/vo/problem-3.wav",
      "text": "And while it waits, the money does nothing."
    },
    {
      "id": "problem-4",
      "section": "problem",
      "start": 24.038,
      "seconds": 5.351,
      "file": "assets/vo/problem-4.wav",
      "text": "If the holder spends it, disappears, or simply makes a mistake, the whole group loses."
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-0",
      "section": "intro",
      "start": 30.971,
      "seconds": 3.603,
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-0.wav",
      "text": "So we built Squad Stake, a mini app inside Nimiq Pay."
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "section": "intro",
      "start": 35.156,
      "seconds": 3.211,
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-1.wav",
      "text": "Save together for anything — and nobody holds the pot."
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "section": "intro",
      "start": 38.949,
      "seconds": 6.375,
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-2.wav",
      "text": "Every member’s share stays in their own wallet, staked on the Nimiq blockchain, earning while the squad waits."
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-3",
      "section": "intro",
      "start": 45.906,
      "seconds": 3.137,
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-3.wav",
      "text": "And the squad’s progress isn’t typed into a database."
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-4",
      "section": "intro",
      "start": 49.625,
      "seconds": 1.661,
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-4.wav",
      "text": "It’s read straight from the chain."
    },
    {
      "id": "create-0",
      "section": "create",
      "start": 52.869,
      "seconds": 4.61,
      "file": "assets/vo/create-0.wav",
      "text": "Signing in is one signature in Nimiq Pay — no account, no password."
    },
    {
      "id": "create-1",
      "section": "create",
      "start": 58.061,
      "seconds": 5.327,
      "file": "assets/vo/create-1.wav",
      "text": "Create a squad: pick a quick start, like a trip, set a goal day, and choose how you save."
    },
    {
      "id": "create-2",
      "section": "create",
      "start": 63.97,
      "seconds": 3.227,
      "file": "assets/vo/create-2.wav",
      "text": "Together goals, where everyone saves their own target."
    },
    {
      "id": "create-3",
      "section": "create",
      "start": 67.779,
      "seconds": 4.046,
      "file": "assets/vo/create-3.wav",
      "text": "Or a shared goal, with one total and a recipient fixed up front."
    },
    {
      "id": "create-4",
      "section": "create",
      "start": 72.407,
      "seconds": 1.713,
      "file": "assets/vo/create-4.wav",
      "text": "Then share one invite link."
    },
    {
      "id": "commit-0",
      "section": "commit",
      "start": 75.702,
      "seconds": 3.142,
      "file": "assets/vo/commit-0.wav",
      "text": "Friends open the link, sign in, and commit their share."
    },
    {
      "id": "commit-1",
      "section": "commit",
      "start": 79.426,
      "seconds": 10.216,
      "file": "assets/vo/commit-1.wav",
      "text": "If they’re not staking yet, Squad Stake picks a staking pool that actually pays its stakers — and shows its name and fee — before Nimiq Pay asks for approval."
    },
    {
      "id": "commit-2",
      "section": "commit",
      "start": 90.224,
      "seconds": 1.97,
      "file": "assets/vo/commit-2.wav",
      "text": "The stake never leaves their wallet."
    },
    {
      "id": "commit-3",
      "section": "commit",
      "start": 92.776,
      "seconds": 5.548,
      "file": "assets/vo/commit-3.wav",
      "text": "A commitment only counts once its transaction is executed and final on the chain."
    },
    {
      "id": "progress-0",
      "section": "progress",
      "start": 99.906,
      "seconds": 2.19,
      "file": "assets/vo/progress-0.wav",
      "text": "Now everyone sees honest progress."
    },
    {
      "id": "progress-1",
      "section": "progress",
      "start": 102.678,
      "seconds": 7.693,
      "file": "assets/vo/progress-1.wav",
      "text": "Saved, short, leaving, back in the wallet — every status comes from a fresh chain read, with its age right beside it."
    },
    {
      "id": "progress-2",
      "section": "progress",
      "start": 110.953,
      "seconds": 2.144,
      "file": "assets/vo/progress-2.wav",
      "text": "Nobody sees anyone else’s balance."
    },
    {
      "id": "progress-3",
      "section": "progress",
      "start": 113.679,
      "seconds": 3.877,
      "file": "assets/vo/progress-3.wav",
      "text": "And the public proof page lets anyone repeat the check themselves."
    },
    {
      "id": "goalday-0",
      "section": "goalday",
      "start": 119.138,
      "seconds": 7.479,
      "file": "assets/vo/goalday-0.wav",
      "text": "Unstaking on Nimiq takes twelve to twenty-four hours, so Squad Stake tells each member exactly when to start leaving."
    },
    {
      "id": "goalday-1",
      "section": "goalday",
      "start": 127.199,
      "seconds": 1.854,
      "file": "assets/vo/goalday-1.wav",
      "text": "Three approvals bring the NIM back."
    },
    {
      "id": "goalday-2",
      "section": "goalday",
      "start": 129.635,
      "seconds": 4.974,
      "file": "assets/vo/goalday-2.wav",
      "text": "For a shared goal, each share is paid to the recipient — and verified on the chain."
    },
    {
      "id": "nim-0",
      "section": "nim",
      "start": 136.191,
      "seconds": 8.792,
      "file": "assets/vo/nim-0.wav",
      "text": "NIM does the heavy lifting: identity by signature, native staking for the savings, payments, and the chain as the source of truth."
    },
    {
      "id": "nim-1",
      "section": "nim",
      "start": 145.565,
      "seconds": 4.793,
      "file": "assets/vo/nim-1.wav",
      "text": "Trips, gifts, rent buffers, group purchases — anything a group saves for."
    },
    {
      "id": "close-0",
      "section": "close",
      "start": 151.941,
      "seconds": 3.198,
      "file": "assets/vo/close-0.wav",
      "text": "No custody. No trust required. Just proof."
    },
    {
      "id": "close-1",
      "section": "close",
      "start": 155.72,
      "seconds": 3.28,
      "file": "assets/vo/close-1.wav",
      "text": "Squad Stake — save together, nobody holds the pot."
    }
  ],
